<p>CHEHLUM KARNE AAYI HAIN ZAINAB ASWS.</p>

<p>BHAAYI SE MILNE AAYI HAIN ZAINAB ASWS.</p>

<p>1. HOO KA MANZAR ZAINAB ASWS. TANHA.</p>

<p>JALTE QAIME ZAINAB ASWS. TANHA.</p>

<p>NANHE BACHE ZAINAB ASWS. TANHA.</p>

<p>AANKHO'N MEIN MANZAR LAAYI HAIN ZAINAB ASWS.</p>

<p>2. YAAD TUJHE KARTI THI SAKINA S.A.</p>

<p>SEENE PE SONE WAALI SAKINA S.A.</p>

<p>MARGAYI ZINDAA'N MEIN WO SAKINA S.A. </p>

<p>SAATH USE NA LAAYI HAIN ZAINAB ASWS.</p>

<p>3. LAAL PE TERE ZULM WO DHAAYE.</p>

<p>TOUQ E GIRAA'N AABID ASWS. KO PINHAYE.</p>

<p>SHIMR E LAYEE'N L.A. KAANTO'N PA CHALAAYE.</p>

<p>YEH BHI SITAM SEH AAYI HAIN ZAINAB ASWS.</p>

<p>4. IBNE ALI ASWS. THE AALE NABI THE.</p>

<p>SAR NANGE BAAZAR GAYE THE.</p>

<p>SAB YEH TAMASHA DEKH RAHE THE.</p>

<p>BAALO'N SE MOO KO DHAANPI HAIN ZAINAB ASWS.</p>

<p>5. BHAYI MERA ABBAS ASWS. NAHI HAIN.</p>

<p>BETA MERA AKBAR ASWS. BHI NAHI HAIN.</p>

<p>ISLIYE CHADAR SAR PE NAHI HAIN.</p>

<p>DEKHO KHULE SAR AAYI HAIN ZAINAB ASWS.</p>

<p>6. BHAIYYA HASSAN ASWS. KI BEWA KHADI HAIN.</p>

<p>IBNE HASSAN ASWS. KI BEWA KHADI HAI .</p>

<p>BAAP SE MILNE BETI KHADI HAIN.</p>

<p>AANKHO'N MEIN MANZAR LAAYI HAIN ZAINAB ASWS.</p>

<p>7. HUMKO GHUM ASGHAR ASWS. KA MILA HAIN.</p>

<p>ASGHARI WAALE SHUKR E QUDA JJH. HAIN.</p>

<p>MURTUZA AB KARBAL KO CHALA HAIN.</p>

<p>BHAYI SE KEHNE AAYI HAIN ZAINAB ASWS.</p>

<p><center><h4>Kalaam: JANAB MURTUZA ALI SAHAB.</h4></center><br />
